# The Hinterlands - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 10 shippable rares and the fixed world
# containers of the Hinterlands. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end
# of the core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is
# not up never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local
# Forever game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE
# dropper anywhere in the data is the rare. Ordinary goods and generic
# multi-zone world drops get a note, not a goal. No tame lines ship (the
# data has no tameability flag and the core guide never sends the player at
# wolves, turtles, or the Razortalon family - see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so
# none are stated. No rare in this guide is a giver, ender, or objective of
# any core-contracted quest. Quest-owned containers (Cortello's Treasure,
# Witherbark and Sharpbeak cages, Highvale set, Call to Arms, Jintha'Alor
# altar, Slagtree's tools, bloodstone, feathers, eggs, supply crates) live
# in the core guides that own those quests or are excluded with reason -
# see docs/hinterlands-companions-inventory.md for the full inventory. This
# guide never accepts or turns in.
guide butler-routes-completionist/the-hinterlands-rares
title The Hinterlands - Rares & Treasures
levels 38-51
zone The Hinterlands
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords hinterlands, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Razortalon - Agol'watha approach

  zone map 1425

  goto 37.06,45.33
  kill 8210 optional
  collect 283545 "Moonchaser's Headdress" optional
  note Level 44 rare bird on the Agol'watha approach; its sole drop is the Moonchaser's Headdress. It also drops the OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon, which starts the core-contracted Find OOX-09/HL (485) - the core guide owns that quest, this step never accepts it.
  note Also drops ordinary bird goods (meat, feathers, eggs) and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Old Cliff Jumper - the west edge

  zone map 1425

  goto 11.92,53.7
  kill 8211 optional
  note Level 42 rare wolf on the far west edge; its drops are wolf meat, pelts and paws (no sole drop in the data), so there is nothing signature to chase. It also spawns across the zone line in Hillsbrad (96.9,14.6 on map 1424).
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step The Reak - the ooze flats

  zone map 1425

  goto 58.88,43.12
  kill 8212 optional
  collect 284043 "Dissolved Link Legguards" optional
  note Level 49 rare ooze on the eastern flats; its sole drop is the Dissolved Link Legguards. Otherwise ordinary ooze goods.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Ironback - the east shore

  zone map 1425

  goto 81.48,49.19
  kill 8213 optional
  note Level 51 rare turtle on the far east shore; its drops are turtle meat, scales and shell pieces (no sole drop in the data), so there is nothing signature to chase.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Jalinde Summerdrake - Agol'watha

  zone map 1425

  goto 30.25,47.95
  kill 8214 optional
  collect 284050 "High Elf's Recurve" optional
  note Level 49 rare at Agol'watha; its sole drop is the High Elf's Recurve. She is Alliance-aligned in the data; the step states that and takes no position beyond it. She also drops the OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon for core-contracted 485 - the core guide owns that quest.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Grimungous - the serpent grounds

  zone map 1425

  goto 70.19,55.38
  kill 8215 optional
  collect 284064 "Cliffbreaker's Pauldrons" optional
  note Level 50 rare elite in the serpent grounds east of Jintha'Alor; its sole drop is the Cliffbreaker's Pauldrons. Otherwise ordinary stone and lockbox goods.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Retherokk the Berserker - Shadra'Alor

  zone map 1425

  goto 50.54,64.13
  kill 8216 optional
  collect 284061 "Berserker's Wraps" optional
  note Level 48 rare troll at Shadra'Alor; its sole drop is the Berserker's Wraps. It also drops the Troll Tribal Necklace for the core-contracted Troll Necklace Bounty (2880/2881) - the core guide owns those quests - and the Wildvine Potion recipe, whose hunt the recipes companion covers.
  note Also drops ordinary troll goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Mith'rethis the Enchanter - Jintha'Alor rise

  zone map 1425

  goto 63.86,77.61
  kill 8217 optional
  collect 17050 "Chan's Imperial Robes" optional
  note Level 52 rare elite above Jintha'Alor; come back at 52 or later. Its sole drop is Chan's Imperial Robes. It also drops the OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon (core 485), the Troll Tribal Necklace (core 2880/2881) and the Wildvine Potion recipe (recipes companion) - this step never accepts any quest.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Witherheart the Stalker - the west wilds

  zone map 1425

  goto 33.12,70.29
  kill 8218 optional
  collect 284046 "Witherheart's Stabber" optional
  note Level 45 rare troll in the western wilds; its sole drop is Witherheart's Stabber. It also drops the Troll Tribal Necklace (core 2880/2881) and the Wildvine Potion recipe (recipes companion) - noted, never accepted here.
  note Also drops ordinary troll goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Zul'arek Hatefowler - Agol'watha south

  zone map 1425

  goto 32.42,56.9
  kill 8219 optional
  collect 284063 "Witherbark Hatecleaver" optional
  note Level 43 rare troll south of Agol'watha; its sole drop is the Witherbark Hatecleaver. It also drops the OOX-09/HL Distress Beacon (core 485), the Troll Tribal Necklace (core 2880/2881) and the Wildvine Potion recipe (recipes companion) - noted, never accepted here.
  note Also drops ordinary goods and generic world greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

