  note One sweep of the zone's fixed world containers (51 points, said plainly): Solid Chests west and center, Solid Chests east and south, Food Crates scattered across the zone. All ordinary goods; the chests may also hold generic world-drop recipes, which are not zone content. No contents are listed in the data for the Food Crates. No quest takes any of them.
